! Edna Turnblad
| Tracy's kind, plus-sized mother – a [[drag (clothing)|drag role]].  Edna runs a laundry business out of her home.
| [[Harvey Fierstein]]
| [[Michael McKean]], [[Bruce Vilanch]], [[John Pinette]], [[Paul C. Vogt]], [[John Travolta]], [[George Wendt]], [[Michael Ball (singer)|Michael Ball]], [[Brian Conley]], [[Phill Jupitus]], [[Trevor Ashley]], [[Nina West]], [[Shane Jacobson]], [[Richard Kind]]
