| [[Mary Bond Davis]]
| [[Darlene Love]], [[Jenifer Lewis]], [[Sharon D Clarke]], [[Queen Latifah]], [[Marisha Wallace]], [[Jennifer Hudson]], [[Asabi Goodman]], [[Siobhan Carter]]
